  "id": "5613937c-7614-45b9-9ec3-2fb2db2f0edc",
  "title": "Unified 3D Gaussian Splatting Frameworks for Realistic Scene Reconstruction",
  "summary": "RealityBridge and CRP-GS introduce advanced methods for 3DGS that address challenges in sparse view synthesis, while LG-HCC improves compression efficiency. Both frameworks enhance 3D reconstruction accuracy and reduce computational demands. RealityBridge combines multimodal controls and lightweight GateNet to enhance 3DGS driving simulations, while the 4D radar-camera framework improves full-scene perception. Both methods address the need for efficient, accurate 3D reconstruction in autonomous driving and medical imaging.",
